### Bottom Revenue Chart

Draw a real stacked bar chart using the supplied revenue history.

Requirements:
- one vertical bar per period, oldest → newest left to right
- stack each bar by **app** (segment per app), not by Apple / Google store
- use only the real per-app values provided
- preserve chronological order
- visually distinguish apps with distinct segment colors (derive from primary / accent / chart colors)
- show a compact legend with app names
- show total bar height from the Total column
- keep period labels readable
